  triage:title "test_observability.rs wait_for_message_contains missing #[cfg(unix)] gate — dead_code error on Windows" ;
  triage:description "The wait_for_message_contains method (or its impl block) in crates/atm-daemon/src/test_observability.rs has no #[cfg(unix)] gate. All call sites are in #[cfg(unix)] test blocks. On Windows, clippy -D warnings promotes dead_code to an error. CI job 'Just lint (windows-latest)' fails. Fix: add #[cfg(unix)] attribute to the wait_for_message_contains method or its enclosing impl block in test_observability.rs." ;
